{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"新成人の皆様"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/15/3652320/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん\nみさみさ\nななみん\nりんご"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうございます★!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"街に溢れる晴れ着姿と輝く笑顔に目を奪われた幸せな日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は珍しく関東で雪が降りました＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと外に出たら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたり一面真っ白"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テンションあがりましたー!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だがしかし......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"交通機関が大パニックになってましたね；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は横浜個握。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参加して下さった皆さん大丈夫でしたか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手の時、皆さんかなり手が冷えていたり\n雪で足もとが濡れている方が多かったので、風邪をひいてしまうのではと心配でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/15/3652320/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪は嬉しいけど、普段から慣れていない私たちはちょっと戸惑いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/15/3652320/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり自然とは偉大だな。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のお洋服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/15/3652320/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/15/3652320/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は可愛いらしい服が着たい気分で、握手会でもワンピースが続いていたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにカジュアルなの着ました★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"迷彩シャツは大好きな ZARA★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/15/3652320/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんがキメてきた((笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩とポケットの部分にはキラキラストーンが沢山付いていて可愛いんです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手では多くのファンの方に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「またスタッズつけてんの??(笑)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これスタッズとは言いません...(-_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n「今日の様な格好が普段の玲香なの??」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と最近質問されるのですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クールな感じも、カジュアルな感じも、可愛い感じも、どんな感じも普段の桜井です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その日によって服の趣味がコロコロ変わるので、普段から色んな格好してるんですよ〜(o・ω・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから最近の気分は、可愛い感じが気になってるのです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/15/3652320/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/15/3652320/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/15/3652320/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑\nらりんの手にまいまい・せーたん・れいかで落書きしました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな鬼太郎のパパを愛情込めて描いてやりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/15/3652320/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オイ、キタロウッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、約２時間後のそこには\nどいやさんが居座っておられました。←らりんBlog参照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の握手も楽しかったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/15/3652320/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は寒い中本当にありがとう♪"}],"source":"archive"}